									</svg>
									Technology architecture and scaling strategies
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start">
									<svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 mt-0.5 mr-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
										<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path>
									</svg>
									Fundraising preparation and investor relations
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start">
									<svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 mt-0.5 mr-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
										<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path>
									</svg>
									Strategic partnerships and market entry
								</li>
							</ul>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="group bg-gradient-to-br from-orange-50 to-orange-100 rounded-2xl shadow-xl border border-orange-200 hover:border-orange-300 p-8 md:p-12 transform hover:-translate-y-2 transition-all duration-300">
					<div class="flex items-start">
						<div class="flex-shrink-0">
							<div class="w-20 h-20 bg-gradient-to-br from-orange-500 to-orange-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">
								<svg class="w-10 h-10 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
									<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 19v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2zm0 0V9a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v10m-6 0a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2z"></path>
								</svg>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="ml-8 flex-1">
							<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-orange-700 to-orange-900 mb-6">Product Creation and Marketing Advisor</h2>
							<p class="text-slate-700 mb-6 text-lg leading-relaxed">
								Transform ideas into market-ready products with strategic guidance on development, positioning, and go-to-market execution. Leverage proven frameworks from successful product launches.
							</p>
							<ul class="space-y-3 text-slate-600">
								<li class="flex items-start">
									<svg class="w-5 h-5 text-orange-400 mt-0.5 mr-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
										<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path>
									</svg>
									Product strategy and roadmap development
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start">
									<svg class="w-5 h-5 text-orange-400 mt-0.5 mr-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
										<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path>
									</svg>
