								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start">
									<svg class="w-5 h-5 text-orange-400 mt-0.5 mr-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
										<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path>
									</svg>
									Go-to-market strategy and launch planning
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start">
									<svg class="w-5 h-5 text-orange-400 mt-0.5 mr-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
										<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path>
									</svg>
									Customer acquisition and growth strategies
								</li>
							</ul>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="group bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-50 to-purple-100 rounded-2xl shadow-xl border border-purple-200 hover:border-purple-300 p-8 md:p-12 transform hover:-translate-y-2 transition-all duration-300">
					<div class="flex items-start">
						<div class="flex-shrink-0">
							<div class="w-20 h-20 bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-500 to-purple-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">
								<svg class="w-10 h-10 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
									<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 20l4-16m4 4l4 4-4 4M6 16l-4-4 4-4"></path>
								</svg>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="ml-8 flex-1">
							<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-700 to-purple-900 mb-6">Technology Solutions</h2>
							<p class="text-slate-700 mb-6 text-lg leading-relaxed">
								Design and implement cutting-edge technology solutions that align with business objectives. From architecture to implementation, ensure your technology investments deliver maximum value.
							</p>
							<ul class="space-y-3 text-slate-600">
								<li class="flex items-start">
									<svg class="w-5 h-5 text-purple-400 mt-0.5 mr-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
										<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path>
									</svg>
									Systems architecture and design
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start">
									<svg class="w-5 h-5 text-purple-400 mt-0.5 mr-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
										<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path>
									</svg>
									Technology stack selection and optimization
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start">
									<svg class="w-5 h-5 text-purple-400 mt-0.5 mr-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
										<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path>
									</svg>
									Integration strategy and implementation
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start">
									<svg class="w-5 h-5 text-purple-400 mt-0.5 mr-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
										<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path>
									</svg>
									Performance optimization and scaling
								</li>
							</ul>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="group bg-gradient-to-br from-red-50 to-red-100 rounded-2xl shadow-xl border border-red-200 hover:border-red-300 p-8 md:p-12 transform hover:-translate-y-2 transition-all duration-300">
					<div class="flex items-start">
						<div class="flex-shrink-0">
							<div class="w-20 h-20 bg-gradient-to-br from-red-500 to-red-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">
								<svg class="w-10 h-10 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
									<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 6V4m0 2a2 2 0 100 4m0-4a2 2 0 110 4m-6 8a2 2 0 100-4m0 4a2 2 0 110-4m0 4v2m0-6V4m6 6v10m6-2a2 2 0 100-4m0 4a2 2 0 110-4m0 4v2m0-6V4"></path>
								</svg>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="ml-8 flex-1">
							<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-red-700 to-red-900 mb-6">Stuck Project Review</h2>
							<p class="text-slate-700 mb-6 text-lg leading-relaxed">
								Unstick stalled initiatives with fresh perspective and proven recovery strategies. We diagnose root causes, develop action plans, and guide teams back to successful delivery.
							</p>
							<ul class="space-y-3 text-slate-600">
								<li class="flex items-start">
									<svg class="w-5 h-5 text-red-400 mt-0.5 mr-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
										<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path>
									</svg>
									Comprehensive project assessment and diagnosis
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start">
									<svg class="w-5 h-5 text-red-400 mt-0.5 mr-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
										<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path>
									</svg>
									Root cause analysis and risk mitigation
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start">
									<svg class="w-5 h-5 text-red-400 mt-0.5 mr-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
										<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path>
									</svg>
									Recovery planning and execution
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start">
									<svg class="w-5 h-5 text-red-400 mt-0.5 mr-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
										<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path>
									</svg>
