				<div class="group bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-50 to-indigo-100 rounded-2xl shadow-xl border border-indigo-200 hover:border-indigo-300 p-8 md:p-12 transform hover:-translate-y-2 transition-all duration-300">
					<div class="flex items-start">
						<div class="flex-shrink-0">
							<div class="w-20 h-20 bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-500 to-indigo-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">
								<svg class="w-10 h-10 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
									<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM7 10a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z"></path>
								</svg>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="ml-8 flex-1">
							<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-700 to-indigo-900 mb-6">Executive Coaching</h2>
							<p class="text-slate-700 mb-6 text-lg leading-relaxed">
								Elevate leadership effectiveness with personalized coaching that combines business acumen, technology insight, and decades of executive experience. Build the skills needed to lead in today's complex environment.
							</p>
							<ul class="space-y-3 text-slate-600">
